# Slice 284 probe: two actuals after a comma, the second a dereference: `add(x, \px)` (BARE-DEREF-ACTUAL-MERGED).  Entry 7.
fn: add (int: a; int: b) int
    return: a + b
end: add
int: x 3
@: px int @ x
int: code 7
if: add(x, \px) != 6
    code: 11
---
if: code = 7 && add(x , \ px) != 6
    code: 12
---
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: code; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
